flowchart TD
    V[VS Code<br/>Chat, completions, slash commands, workspace context]:::focus
    V --> J[JetBrains<br/>Chat, completions, most slash commands]
    J --> VS[Visual Studio<br/>Chat, completions]
    VS --> G[GitHub.com Enterprise<br/>Chat in PRs, issues, search]
